## Objection Handling

### "You're too expensive"

**Response**: "I understand. Let's break down the ROI. Our average customer sees 40% reduction in care coordinator admin time. For a team of 20, that's 8 FTEs worth of time—far exceeding the investment. What does your care coordination cost today?"

### "We're happy with our current solution"

**Response**: "That's great to hear. Out of curiosity, what's working well? [Listen] And if you could improve one thing? [Listen] That's exactly what we hear from organizations who switch to MedSync..."

### "We don't have budget"

**Response**: "Budget is definitely a consideration. When does your planning cycle start? Also, many of our customers fund this through care management or IT budgets, or through ROI-based business cases. Would it be helpful if I shared how similar organizations have justified the investment?"

### "We need to see Epic/Cerner integration"

**Response**: "Absolutely—integration is critical. We're an Epic Gold Partner and Cerner certified. We have 100+ live integrations and our average go-live is 12 weeks. Would you like to speak with a customer on the same EHR?"

