## Sales Process

### Stage 1: Discovery (10%)
- Identify pain points
- Qualify MEDDIC elements
- Establish champion
- Deliverable: Discovery summary

### Stage 2: Qualification (20%)
- Complete MEDDIC qualification
- Confirm budget and timeline
- Demo scheduled
- Deliverable: Qualified opportunity

### Stage 3: Demo/Evaluation (40%)
- Product demonstration
- Technical validation
- Clinical workflow review
- Deliverable: Technical win

### Stage 4: Proposal (60%)
- Pricing proposal delivered
- ROI/business case
- Reference calls completed
- Deliverable: Proposal presented

### Stage 5: Negotiation (80%)
- Contract redlines
- Legal/procurement review
- Final approvals in progress
- Deliverable: Final terms agreed

### Stage 6: Closed Won (100%)
- Contract signed
- Handoff to implementation
- Deliverable: Signed agreement

